---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About — Coyote & Quill"
  description="The firm's credibility is not borrowed. Retired Marine Corps Lieutenant Colonel and AH-1W Cobra pilot. TTECG Coyote. AI adoption practitioner and combat advisor."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label">The Firm</p>
      <h1>The credentials are not borrowed.</h1>
      <p>Coyote &amp; Quill was built on a foundation that most consulting firms cannot replicate — earned in the cockpit, on the training range, and at the operational edge.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div>
          <p class="label">Founder</p>
          <h2>Glen Lewis</h2>
          <p class="founder-rank">Lieutenant Colonel, U.S. Marine Corps (Retired)</p>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>Retired United States Marine Corps AH-1W Cobra pilot. TTECG Coyote — a training advisor and opposing force observer at the Marine Corps Tactical Training and Exercise Control Group, training unit commanders to think, not just react.</p>
          <p>Combat advisor who trained Mongolian, Georgian, and Iraqi Security Forces in operational tactics and leadership — embedding in unfamiliar cultures and organizations, reading them accurately, and helping their people build capabilities they could carry forward on their own. That is the same work, now applied to AI: looking across a client's culture and organization to identify and implement solutions they keep long after the engagement ends.</p>
          <p>AI adoption practitioner simultaneously building and deploying AI systems at a healthcare startup across product, operations, compliance, and customer success. Author. Solo developer with a full-stack capability and a track record of shipping real products.</p>
          <p>Coyote &amp; Quill is a Washington State Certified Veteran-Owned Business.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img class="founder-photo" src="/glen-lewis.jpg" alt="Glen Lewis, founder of Coyote & Quill" width="600" height="800" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="label">Background</p>
        <h2>Four pillars. All earned.</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">Combat Aviation</p>
          <h3>AH-1W Cobra Pilot</h3>
          <p>Retired United States Marine Corps attack helicopter pilot. Combat-tested decision-making under pressure, systems thinking, and mission execution when the cost of error is not theoretical.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">Training &amp; Advisory</p>
          <h3>TTECG Coyote</h3>
          <p>Served as a training advisor and opposing force observer at the Marine Corps Tactical Training and Exercise Control Group. Trained international forces — Mongolian, Georgian, and Iraqi Security Forces — in operational tactics and command decision-making.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">AI Practitioner</p>
          <h3>Operational AI Deployment</h3>
          <p>Building and deploying AI systems at a healthcare startup across product management, operations, compliance, and customer success simultaneously — not in a sandbox, in production.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">Builder</p>
          <h3>Creator &amp; Author</h3>
          <p>Creator and copyright holder of TraceWell, a proprietary healthcare SaaS platform. Author of an AI adoption framework for non-technical leaders using the DOTMLPF-P military readiness model.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="label">Mission &amp; Values</p>
        <h2>A firm defined by precision,<br />not by size.</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-box">
        <p>To deliver clear-eyed strategy, precise execution, and durable tools to organizations navigating the adoption of artificial intelligence and complex operational change — with the discipline of a combat advisor and the craft of a practitioner.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Accuracy over speed</h3>
          <p>Assess the real problem before proposing a solution. The wrong answer delivered fast is still wrong.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Build over advise</h3>
          <p>Every engagement should produce something the client keeps using after we leave. Advice without implementation is just a memo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Earned credibility</h3>
          <p>The founder's background is verifiable. The firm's claims are not marketing — they are documented, demonstrated, and on record.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Next Step</p>
      <h2 style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 24px;">See what the firm builds.</h2>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/services" class="btn btn-primary">View Services</a>
        <a href="/tracewell" class="btn btn-outline">See TraceWell</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .founder-rank {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--ice-blue);
    margin: 4px 0 0;
  }
  .founder-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 96, 128, 0.25);
  }
</style>
